--
-- The root program a peer runs, as the API serves it: the config endpoint
-- puts this string in `program.source` so one downloaded file is the whole
-- deployment. Generated by api/gen-peer-program.py from
-- deploy/gate1/relay/wg_rendezvous.dlua, which is the file to edit.
--
-- run.sh refuses when this is behind its owner.
